A form feed or a no-break space is content wherever whitespace is tested

```
a /x/ b

a /x/ b
.
<p>a <em>x</em> b</p>
<p>a <em>x</em> b</p>
```

```
`  `
.
<p><code></code></p>
```

```
|a|b|
.
<p>|a|b|</p>
```

```
:: 
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt></dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: d
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: +

b
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>+</dd>
</dl>
<p>b</p>
```

```
- +

b
.
<ul>
  <li>+</li>
</ul>
<p>b</p>
```

```
- a
  - +

b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>+</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>b</p>
```

```
---yaml
a: 1
---

t
.
<p>---yaml
a: 1</p>
<hr>
<p>t</p>
```

```
# a b

[a b][]
.
<section id="a b">
  <h1>a&nbsp;b</h1>
  <p>[a b][]</p>
</section>
```

```
#  ab

[ab][]
.
<section id=" ab">
  <h1>&nbsp;ab</h1>
  <p>[ab][]</p>
</section>
```

```
/*x*/ y
.
<p><strong><em>x</em></strong> y</p>
```
